From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] gdi32: OpenType contextual lookups, alternate glyphs, feature filtering

GSUB ChainContextSubst format 1, GPOS ContextPos format 1 and 3, GPOS
ChainContextPos format 1 and 2 are applied; ScriptGetFontAlternateGlyphs lists
the alternates of a feature; ScriptGetFontFeatureTags hides the features the
script's shaping engine requires. CORE: integrator must review
(patches/notes/5224.txt).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS
---

